Chase H.Q. - Instructions
=========================
Drive after the criminals' car, catch up and ram it until it
stops, before time runs out.

The keys are the original game's defaults, which the in-game
redefine option can change:

    K / L      steer left / right
    A / Z      accelerate / brake
    N          change gear
    Space      turbo boost

The cursor keys emulate a Kempston joystick. Keypad Enter is
its fire button.

Window keys
-----------
    F10        full screen (Escape to leave)
    F11        scale the view
    Ctrl-N     monochrome
    Ctrl-O     sound on or off
    Ctrl-P     pause
    F5 / F6    slower / 100% speed
    F7         faster
    Ctrl-V     scaled to fit
